{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Listen. Observe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal spacewalking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large pool complex with various rooms and themes and be enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer's handcrafted soundtrack provides relaxation or anxiety depending on your location. No monsters or cheap jump scares tho! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, feelings of unease, confusion, and confinement may arise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle events and sophisticated sound design immerse the player in the game world \u2013 there is no interface or mission objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on exploring the detailed and beautifully lit levels and finding the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Waters requires modern hardware, at least 8gb Vram. Laptop devices may not be supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is not designed to run on Steam Deck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has controller support, so sit back and enjoy your trip into the strange and mysterious pool rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric Exploration Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2 Hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Environments and Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Graphics featuring the latest Unreal Engine 5 tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maze like levels. Straight forward level design that doesn't waste your time by looping the player around.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/86a55c960d54591ea11657729fa1b51ed77975e3.jpg"},{"name":"Dark but Cozy...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/279dd8da4ffcf8eea8c745c2fbe6540618251517.jpg"},{"name":"Who's screaming?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/8d24fa61f1e56f5c8ac1ea5deeec3519829177de.jpg"},{"name":"Trapped Forever.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/71ceda4a0574f1e9819f4e595b2f33389bfe1991.jpg"},{"name":"Where is the Janitor?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/c09ab9eb38ff678d63f3068c26fab51d8617bcb0.jpg"},{"name":"An eerie Presence...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/0443c5a2bfc0cb1969fa2b5deef27140d2a754d9.jpg"},{"name":"THE KING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/49729daccff6aa58fba0ab4e34f3b6acbd33a7ee.jpg"},{"name":"I knew it wasn't the Exit...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/7534e28c532d652b51758ef61d7f35f547354f35.jpg"},{"name":"Leap of Faith!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/dda947cb1a2dfc850e788d353a1e68bf9754dfd0.jpg"},{"name":"Submechanophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015300/f5b131f5b033db097843cc67989fcba239b3e43c.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015300?t=1771752990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015300?t=1771752990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015300/721a8e44aed0b7f5036c4361eea193755b9a418d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771752990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015300/721a8e44aed0b7f5036c4361eea193755b9a418d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771752990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Listen. Observe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIMINAL WATERS is a liminal spacewalking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large pool complex with various rooms and themes and be enchanted by the radiant beauty of Unreal Engine 5.6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer's handcrafted soundtrack provides relaxation or anxiety depending on your location. No monsters or cheap jump scares tho! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, feelings of unease, confusion, and confinement may arise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle events and sophisticated sound design immerse the player in the game world \u2013 there is no interface or mission objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on exploring the detailed and beautifully lit levels and finding the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Waters requires modern hardware, at least 8gb Vram. Laptop devices may not be supported!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is not designed to run on Steam Deck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has controller support, so sit back and enjoy your trip into the strange and mysterious pool rooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric Exploration Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2 Hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted Environments and Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Graphics featuring the latest Unreal Engine 5 tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No maze like levels. Straight forward level design that doesn't waste your time by looping the player around.</p></li></ul>","developers":["DK Productions","Silent Snake"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015300/a0dd5261b7fb81bd1862829e5497ebc2365c26de/header.jpg?t=1771752990","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015300/488437288/11b3d0e8b8fd7d26b01ea65e001e3d3ff4c6a782/1757180133/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758633731","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015300/488437288/11b3d0e8b8fd7d26b01ea65e001e3d3ff4c6a782/1757180133/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758633731","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015300/488437288/11b3d0e8b8fd7d26b01ea65e001e3d3ff4c6a782/1757180133/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758633731","id":257194005,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194005/e0730828dd17b6539a98d7185205b294dd557ee4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758633731"}],"name":"LIMINAL WATERS","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_lic